  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening FAHP for the Coordination of FGM red</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of this project is to deliver FGM/C reduction interventions in a coordinated manner and that communities become aware of and take actions to reduce/end FGM/C. The project has three objectives: enhance the capacity of FAHP to Coordinate FGM/C Interventions in Sierra Leone; influence the enactment of a national law on the abandonment of FGM/C; and increase community awareness and knowledge on the harmful effects of FGM/C</narrative>
  </description>
